# A perpetual covenant: every spend must recreate THIS exact script, paying itself minus a
# fixed hop fee. The coin never leaves the lock — it moves forward through identical UTXOs,
# shrinking by the fee each hop. recreate() reads the script out of the preimage, so it never
# needs its own hash. Compiles BYTE-IDENTICAL to the deployed `perpetual` predicate.
#   sci deploy examples/perpetual.expr hopFee=150
recreate(this.hopFee)
